# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces. private/ is meant to live OUTSIDE this repo entirely, as a
# sibling of it. If it ever lands inside by accident -- a mistyped mv, a
# relative path off by one directory -- git must refuse to stage it rather
# than quietly publishing plans, transcripts and design docs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/
**/private/
